50,3,1,talk,Mio,,"We have Campus Intensive, Mountain Training Centre, or Coastal Lodge. I'm leaning away from the lodge due to the deposits.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The lodge would keep us together, but the Mountain Centre is a public facility. Campus is the most accessible.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Campus is a mess for the staff and the schedule. The Mountain Centre is too much paperwork.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Rin,,I hate the sound of the Mountain Centre's dorms. Campus is too busy. The lodge sounds nice!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Campus requires too many beds for commuters. The Mountain Centre is cheap, but the lodge is a private let.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mio,,"If we go to the lodge, who pays if someone cancels? That's a big worry for me.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Shizue,,But the lodge ensures we actually spend time together. That is vital for the club's future.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,The lodge avoids the lottery and the cooking duties. It seems the most reasonable for the organizers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Rin,,I just want a place where we can actually sleep! The lodge is the best bet for that.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"The lodge is far, so transport will be expensive. But it avoids the campus bed issue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'll vote for the Mountain Centre. It's safer for the budget than the lodge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I will vote for the Coastal Lodge to encourage the members to bond.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge. I cannot deal with that public booking application.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Coastal Lodge for me! No eight-person rooms, please.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll go with the Mountain Training Centre. We need to keep the costs predictable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
